WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.687 --> 00:00:14.988
&gt;&gt; Laura: BIG NEWS OUT OF THE

00:00:14.421 --> 00:00:15.689
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE TONIGHT.

00:00:15.122 --> 00:00:17.157
ATTORNEY GENERAL JEFF SESSIONS

00:00:15.822 --> 00:00:18.925
ANNOUNCING THAT HE WILL NOT BE

00:00:17.291 --> 00:00:19.593
APPOINTING A SECOND SPECIAL

00:00:19.059 --> 00:00:21.194
COUNSEL TO REVIEW THE FBI'S

00:00:19.726 --> 00:00:23.297
HANDLING OF THE RUSSIA AND

00:00:21.328 --> 00:00:26.500
HILLARY CLINTON PROBE.

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:27.768
IN A LETTER TO THREE

00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:29.303
CONGRESSIONAL LEADERS, SESSIONS

00:00:27.901 --> 00:00:29.870
NOTICE THAT SPECIAL COUNSEL'S

00:00:29.436 --> 00:00:31.705
ARE ONLY APPOINTED IN

00:00:30.003 --> 00:00:33.840
EXTRAORDINARY CIRCUMSTANCES.

00:00:31.838 --> 00:00:35.642
AND THAT, INSTEAD, HE HAS

00:00:33.974 --> 00:00:40.347
ASSIGNED JOHN HUBER IN UTAH TO

00:00:35.776 --> 00:00:41.748
CONDUCT A REVIEW OF THE MOST

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:46.153
HIGH-PROFILE CASES.

00:00:41.882 --> 00:00:46.787
OF COURSE, AND "INTERMINGLE"

00:00:46.286 --> 00:00:46.787
EXCLUSIVE, AND FIRING ANDREW

00:00:47.187 --> 00:00:53.160
McCABE OF THE FBI, JUST DAYS

00:00:50.557 --> 00:00:55.128
BEFORE THE RETIREMENT, CITING AN

00:00:53.293 --> 00:00:55.729
IG REPORT, THAT HE LIED UNDER

00:00:55.262 --> 00:00:56.663
OATH.

00:00:55.862 --> 00:00:58.799
THE PUBLIC STILL HASN'T SEEN

00:00:56.797 --> 00:01:02.336
THAT REPORT, BUT JOINING ME NOW

00:00:58.932 --> 00:01:03.270
ARE TWO MEN WHOSE OFFICES HAVE A

00:01:02.469 --> 00:01:03.570
COPY OF THE INSPECTOR GENERAL'S

00:01:03.403 --> 00:01:05.806
COPY.

00:01:03.704 --> 00:01:07.741
LET'S BRING IN, FROM COLUMBUS,

00:01:05.939 --> 00:01:09.376
OHIO, JIM JORDAN, AND WITH ME

00:01:07.874 --> 00:01:10.110
HERE IN THE STUDIO,

00:01:09.509 --> 00:01:12.546
NORTH CAROLINA CONGRESSMAN,

00:01:10.243 --> 00:01:13.980
MARK MEADOWS, ALSO REPUBLICAN.

00:01:12.679 --> 00:01:15.349
LET'S START WITH YOU,

00:01:14.114 --> 00:01:16.183
CONGRESSMAN JORDAN, WHAT IS THE

00:01:15.482 --> 00:01:18.118
HEADLINE THAT IS GOING TO COME

00:01:16.316 --> 00:01:18.552
OUT OF THIS INSPECTOR GENERAL

00:01:18.251 --> 00:01:20.587
REPORT?

00:01:18.685 --> 00:01:21.321
&gt;&gt; WELL, WE DON'T KNOW WHAT WILL

00:01:20.721 --> 00:01:23.256
COME OUT OF THAT, BUT WE KNOW

00:01:21.455 --> 00:01:25.525
ABOUT ANDREW McCABE, HE DIDN'T

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:28.995
LIE JUST ONCE, HE LIED FOUR

00:01:25.659 --> 00:01:30.130
TIMES, FOR GOOD TIMES, HE COMEY,

00:01:29.129 --> 00:01:32.132
TO THE OFFICE OF FISCAL

00:01:30.263 --> 00:01:32.699
RESPONSIBILITY, AND LIED UNDER

00:01:32.265 --> 00:01:33.734
OATH TO THE

00:01:32.833 --> 00:01:35.335
INSPECTOR GENERAL.

00:01:33.867 --> 00:01:37.537
REMEMBER, THIS IS ANDREW

00:01:35.469 --> 00:01:40.340
McCABE, DEPUTY DIRECTOR OF THE

00:01:37.671 --> 00:01:41.742
FBI, ANDREW ANDREW McCABE, THE

00:01:40.474 --> 00:01:42.909
TEXT MESSAGES BETWEEN PETER

00:01:41.875 --> 00:01:45.178
STRZOK AND LISA PAGE, TALKING

00:01:43.043 --> 00:01:46.546
ABOUT THE INSURANCE POLICY IN

00:01:45.312 --> 00:01:48.181
CASE DONALD TRUMP WAS ACTUALLY

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:49.282
PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES,

00:01:48.315 --> 00:01:53.420
SO THAT IS WHY THIS IS

00:01:49.416 --> 00:01:54.421
SIGNIFICANT, IT WASN'T ONCE,

00:01:53.553 --> 00:01:55.822
TWICE, FOUR TIMES HE LIED ABOUT

00:01:54.554 --> 00:01:56.790
LEAKING INFORMATION TO

00:01:55.956 --> 00:01:57.357
"THE WALL STREET JOURNAL" ABOUT

00:01:56.923 --> 00:01:58.358
THE FBI.

00:01:57.491 --> 00:02:01.128
&gt;&gt; Laura: CONGRESSMAN MEADOWS,

00:01:58.492 --> 00:02:05.332
HE WAS ADAMANT IN THE OP-ED THAT

00:02:01.261 --> 00:02:06.066
HIS CAREER SPEAKS FOR ITSELF,

00:02:05.465 --> 00:02:08.602
THAT HE WAS AUTHORIZED TO SPEAK

00:02:06.199 --> 00:02:11.138
AS HE DID TO THE PRESS, AND YET

00:02:08.735 --> 00:02:11.438
YOU GUYS ARE SAYING HE LIED FOUR

00:02:11.271 --> 00:02:14.374
TIMES.

00:02:11.571 --> 00:02:15.342
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT'S NOT OUR WORDS,

00:02:14.508 --> 00:02:16.743
IT'S ACTUALLY THE INDEPENDENT

00:02:15.475 --> 00:02:17.144
INVESTIGATION WAS DONE BY HIS

00:02:16.877 --> 00:02:19.513
COLLEAGUES.

00:02:17.277 --> 00:02:19.946
WHEN YOU READ IT, IT'S NOT ABOUT

00:02:19.646 --> 00:02:21.982
POLITICS.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:24.184
YOU BROKE THE NEWS, ACTUALLY,

00:02:22.115 --> 00:02:26.620
YOU BROKE THE NEWS RIGHT HERE A

00:02:24.317 --> 00:02:28.488
LITTLE OVER A WEEK AGO NOW, AND

00:02:26.753 --> 00:02:30.690
WHAT WE ARE FINDING, EVERYBODY

00:02:28.622 --> 00:02:32.092
SAYING, THIS IS POLITICAL IN

00:02:30.824 --> 00:02:34.428
NATURE, WHEN YOU READ THE

00:02:32.225 --> 00:02:36.530
REPORT, YOU SEE IT IS NOT

00:02:34.561 --> 00:02:39.800
POLITICAL, BECAUSE UNDER OATH,

00:02:36.663 --> 00:02:38.865
CERTAINLY WITH THE INVESTIGATION

00:02:38.865 --> 00:02:40.467
CERTAINLY WITH THE INVESTIGATIO

00:02:39.933 --> 00:02:44.738
INVESTIGATION, A REAL CRIME.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:45.972
HERE IS WHY IT IS CRITICAL.

00:02:44.871 --> 00:02:47.874
ATTORNEY GENERAL SESSIONS, JUST

00:02:46.106 --> 00:02:49.509
TALK ABOUT EXTRAORDINARY

00:02:48.008 --> 00:02:53.180
CIRCUMSTANCES, HOW MUCH MORE

00:02:49.643 --> 00:02:55.515
EXTRAORDINARY WILL YOU BE, YOU

00:02:53.313 --> 00:02:56.683
FIRE THE CENTRAL PLAYER IN THE

00:02:55.649 --> 00:02:57.584
INVESTIGATION, THAT IS ONE

00:02:56.817 --> 00:02:59.653
CRITICAL COMPONENT.

00:02:57.717 --> 00:03:01.488
WE NEED TO HAVE THE SPECIAL

00:02:59.786 --> 00:03:02.055
COUNSEL.

00:03:01.621 --> 00:03:03.757
I DISAGREE WITH THE

00:03:02.189 --> 00:03:05.826
ATTORNEY GENERAL, I CAN TELL YOU

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:07.127
TONIGHT, I WENT THROUGH AND

00:03:05.959 --> 00:03:10.096
VIEWED SOME REDACTED THINGS THAT

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:12.499
WERE GIVEN TO OUR COMMITTEE, AND

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:14.301
ON SEVEN PAGES, THERE WERE 12

00:03:12.632 --> 00:03:15.735
MATERIAL FACTS -- MATERIAL

00:03:14.434 --> 00:03:17.637
FACTS, NOT JUST NAMES --

00:03:15.869 --> 00:03:18.338
MATERIAL FACTS THAT WERE OMITTED

00:03:17.771 --> 00:03:20.140
BY THE DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE.

00:03:18.472 --> 00:03:21.942
IT IS TIME THAT THEY COME CLEAN

00:03:20.273 --> 00:03:22.342
AND GIVE CONGRESS WHAT THEY

00:03:22.075 --> 00:03:23.343
NEED.

00:03:22.476 --> 00:03:24.811
&gt;&gt; Laura: 12?

00:03:23.477 --> 00:03:25.779
&gt;&gt; 12 MATERIAL FACTS.

00:03:24.945 --> 00:03:27.481
WHAT I'M TALKING ABOUT IS, YOU

00:03:25.912 --> 00:03:31.284
KNOW THE NEWS BROKE ABOUT THE

00:03:27.614 --> 00:03:32.519
MEETING THAT HAPPENED WITH

00:03:31.418 --> 00:03:34.054
DENIS McDONOUGH --

00:03:32.652 --> 00:03:34.955
&gt;&gt; Laura: THE FORMER

00:03:34.187 --> 00:03:35.555
WHITE HOUSE CHIEF OF STAFF FOR

00:03:35.088 --> 00:03:36.590
BARACK OBAMA.

00:03:35.689 --> 00:03:39.559
&gt;&gt; THAT WAS REDACTED.

00:03:36.723 --> 00:03:41.361
BUT IT DIDN'T STOP THERE.

00:03:39.693 --> 00:03:44.631
WHEN WE LOOK AT THE MULTIPLE

00:03:41.495 --> 00:03:45.732
REACTIONS THAT HAVE TAKEN PLACE,

00:03:44.764 --> 00:03:46.867
THIS DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE IS

00:03:45.866 --> 00:03:49.703
NOT COMPLYING WITH THE SUBPOENA

00:03:49.836 --> 00:03:51.271
RESPONSIBILITY WE HAVE IN

00:03:51.037 --> 00:03:52.906
CONGRESS.

00:03:51.404 --> 00:03:56.576
FOR THE ATTORNEY GENERAL TO

00:03:53.039 --> 00:03:57.911
SUGGEST THAT THERE IS NOT ENOUGH

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.345
THERE IS EXTREMELY

00:03:58.044 --> 00:03:59.145
DISAPPOINTING.

00:03:58.478 --> 00:04:00.213
&gt;&gt; Laura: CONGRESSMAN JORDAN,

00:03:59.279 --> 00:04:02.015
IT SOUNDS LIKE YOUR COLLEAGUE,

00:04:00.347 --> 00:04:07.687
CONGRESSMAN MEADOWS, IS SAYING

00:04:02.148 --> 00:04:09.523
THAT --    -- I MEAN, THERE IS A

00:04:07.821 --> 00:04:11.691
REASON TO REDACT INFORMATION,

00:04:09.656 --> 00:04:18.832
WHETHER IT WAS A RELATIONSHIP

00:04:11.825 --> 00:04:21.801
WITH JUDGE CONTRERAS,

00:04:18.965 --> 00:04:26.306
RELATIONSHIP ABOUT McDONOUGH.

00:04:21.935 --> 00:04:27.941
&gt;&gt; WE GO IN THE ROOM, IT IS

00:04:26.439 --> 00:04:29.109
RIDICULOUS, BUT MARK IS EXACTLY

00:04:28.074 --> 00:04:30.710
RIGHT, WHEN THE ATTORNEY GENERAL

00:04:29.242 --> 00:04:31.511
WRITES CONGRESS AND SAYS, ONLY

00:04:30.844 --> 00:04:33.246
UNDER EXTRAORDINARY

00:04:31.645 --> 00:04:35.348
CIRCUMSTANCES TO BE APPOINTED

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:38.318
SECOND SPECIAL COUNSEL, WELL,

00:04:35.482 --> 00:04:40.487
HOW 'BOUT THESE STATS, LAURA?

00:04:38.451 --> 00:04:41.187
JAMES COMEY HAS BEEN FIRED,

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.222
DEPUTY DIRECTOR ANDREW McCABE

00:04:41.321 --> 00:04:44.257
HAS BEEN FIRED, JIM BAKER,

00:04:42.355 --> 00:04:46.092
FORMER CHIEF COUNSEL OF THE FBI

00:04:44.391 --> 00:04:48.328
HAS BEEN DEMOTED AND REASSIGNED,

00:04:46.226 --> 00:04:49.596
PETER STRZOK, FORMER DEPUTY HEAD

00:04:48.461 --> 00:04:51.097
OF COUNTERINTELLIGENCE HAS BEEN

00:04:49.729 --> 00:04:52.198
REASSIGNED, AND LISA PAGE,

00:04:51.231 --> 00:04:54.501
FORMER FBI COUNCIL, HAS BEEN

00:04:52.332 --> 00:04:55.368
DEMOTED AND REASSIGNED.

00:04:54.634 --> 00:04:56.803
IF THOSE AREN'T EXTRAORDINARY

00:04:55.502 --> 00:04:58.738
CIRCUMSTANCES WARRANTING A

00:04:56.937 --> 00:04:59.306
SECOND SPECIAL COUNSEL, I DON'T

00:04:58.872 --> 00:05:01.074
KNOW WHAT THE HECK IS.

00:04:59.439 --> 00:05:02.542
SO I DON'T KNOW WHY THE

00:05:01.207 --> 00:05:03.009
ATTORNEY GENERAL KEEPS

00:05:02.676 --> 00:05:04.477
POSTPONING THIS.

00:05:03.143 --> 00:05:06.112
EVERYBODY KNOWS WE NEED A SECOND

00:05:04.611 --> 00:05:06.580
SPECIAL COUNSEL TO GET TO THE

00:05:06.246 --> 00:05:10.350
BOTTOM OF THIS.

00:05:06.713 --> 00:05:14.087
HOW CAN MR. HUBER -- I DON'T

00:05:10.483 --> 00:05:17.924
KNOW MUCH ABOUT MR. HUBER, HE'S

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:19.192
PROBABLY VERY GOOD -- WE HAVE

00:05:18.058 --> 00:05:20.860
ALL OF THIS PFIZER ABUSE WITHIN

00:05:19.326 --> 00:05:22.963
TOOK PLACE, YOU HAVE TO HAVE A

00:05:20.994 --> 00:05:23.863
SECOND SPECIAL COUNSEL, I HOPE

00:05:23.096 --> 00:05:25.332
JUST JEFF SESSIONS FIGURES THIS

00:05:23.997 --> 00:05:27.334
OUT.

00:05:25.465 --> 00:05:28.802
&gt;&gt; Laura: THIS IS WHAT ONE OF

00:05:27.467 --> 00:05:32.138
YOUR CHIEF CRITICS ON ANOTHER

00:05:28.935 --> 00:05:34.407
NETWORK SAID ON THE QUESTION.

00:05:32.272 --> 00:05:36.710
&gt;&gt; WAS THERE EVER A STRONG CASE

00:05:34.541 --> 00:05:37.043
FOR APPOINTING A SECOND SPECIAL

00:05:36.843 --> 00:05:37.344
COUNSEL?

00:05:37.177 --> 00:05:39.679
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:05:37.477 --> 00:05:42.082
AS FAR AS I COULD TELL, MOST OF

00:05:39.813 --> 00:05:44.351
THE ACCUSATIONS AGAINST THE FBI

00:05:42.215 --> 00:05:46.886
WERE GOING TO LUNATIC CONSPIRACY

00:05:44.484 --> 00:05:48.955
THEORIES, JUST NOT GROUNDED IN

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:49.556
ANYTHING, AND I THINK THE

00:05:49.089 --> 00:05:53.193
ATTORNEY GENERAL DID AN

00:05:49.689 --> 00:05:53.927
APPROPRIATE THING HERE.

00:05:53.326 --> 00:05:56.162
&gt;&gt; Laura: CONGRESSMAN MEADOWS?

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:57.097
&gt;&gt; WE LOOK AT THE FACTS, THE

00:05:56.296 --> 00:05:57.530
FACTS SPEAK FOR THEMSELVES,

00:05:57.230 --> 00:06:00.734
LAURA.

00:05:57.664 --> 00:06:01.635
WHEN WE ARE LOOKING AT, IS IT A

00:06:00.867 --> 00:06:03.336
MATERIAL FACT THAT PETER STRZOK

00:06:01.768 --> 00:06:04.738
HAD A RELATIONSHIP WITH A FISA

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:05.005
JUDGE AND THEY CONCEALED IT,

00:06:04.871 --> 00:06:07.641
YES.

00:06:05.138 --> 00:06:10.944
IS IT A FACT -- AND WE NOW KNOW

00:06:07.774 --> 00:06:14.581
THAT THE INVESTIGATION ENDED --

00:06:11.077 --> 00:06:16.650
DONALD TRUMP STARTED LATE JULY,

00:06:14.714 --> 00:06:18.018
THERE WAS A MEETING WITH THE

00:06:16.783 --> 00:06:21.087
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE, THEY SAID

00:06:18.151 --> 00:06:21.721
THE WHITE HOUSE IS LEADING THIS.

00:06:21.221 --> 00:06:23.490
&gt;&gt; Laura: I THINK A LOT OF

00:06:21.855 --> 00:06:26.793
FOLKS MISSED THAT WHEN THIS

00:06:23.623 --> 00:06:30.530
HAPPENED THE OTHER DAY, THAT THE

00:06:26.926 --> 00:06:32.032
WHITE HOUSE IS LEADING.

00:06:30.664 --> 00:06:33.466
&gt;&gt; WE GOT TEXT MESSAGES THAT

00:06:32.165 --> 00:06:34.234
WOULD SUGGEST THAT YOU PAID

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:36.770
WITHIN SEVEN DAYS OF THAT, WE

00:06:34.367 --> 00:06:39.906
HAD A MEETING WITH THE

00:06:36.903 --> 00:06:41.574
WHITE HOUSE, CHIEF OF STAFF,

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:44.310
WE CAN'T DRAW A CONCLUSION, BUT

00:06:41.708 --> 00:06:47.180
WE CAN CERTAINLY LOOK AT THE

00:06:44.444 --> 00:06:47.781
FACTS, AND THE FACTS DO SPEAK TO

00:06:47.313 --> 00:06:49.916
FURTHER INVESTIGATION.

00:06:47.914 --> 00:06:50.350
&gt;&gt; Laura: WHY CAN'T HE BRING

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.284
McDONOUGH AND?

00:06:50.483 --> 00:06:52.519
&gt;&gt; I THINK THAT WOULD BE THE

00:06:51.418 --> 00:06:53.753
APPROPRIATE THING TO DO, BUT

00:06:52.652 --> 00:06:55.455
IT'S NOT JUST THERE.

